@title Schematic problems are triangles on the object
@area Schematic
# T0b: the checks draw a red solid or yellow hollow triangle on the symbol or wire, the pill counts them, the list leads with the same triangle.
open crates/novo-tests/tests/golden/v0.1-motor-starter.novo
wait 20
expect_scene K1
shot triangles-on-drawing
check_layout
# The pill is the one count; a click opens the list of the same problems.
click_text "warning" Button
wait 10
expect "F8 next"
shot triangles-list
check_layout
# F8 locates the next problem on the drawing.
key F8
wait 10
shot triangles-f8
